      <key>com.lihbr.kuronuri.source</key>
      <string>Drawn: a bowl as Redaction o's left side, whose stroke goes on from its top down to the right, thick, to a's tail, and from its bottom up to the right, thin, to a ball as c's, joined to it by r's step; they cross as x's strokes do, straight through, x's notch cut into the thick one above and below</string>
